  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "論囡仔人ê學習關鍵期"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdXN17HPRSZxPrefQJZFwDNJu6wx3OkTq3LWTvgEGde__l75VDFzHUf9wvWnGxV7Xb9XsUmVzBZR1sijWCpH93fGkCFE_Fbp7F2H4SzS0lyWpa3nyG8UTnDqt7J693jPmVp_fE3fxBOF4o/s762/931+%25E9%2586%25AB%25E5%25AD%25B8+%25E6%259C%25B1%25E5%25AD%2590%25E5%25AE%258F+%25E8%25AB%2596%25E5%259B%25A1%25E4%25BB%2594%25E4%25BA%25BA%25C3%25AA%25E5%25AD%25B8%25E7%25BF%2592%25E9%2597%259C%25E9%258D%25B5%25E6%259C%259F_%25E5%259C%2596.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"469\" data-original-width=\"762\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdXN17HPRSZxPrefQJZFwDNJu6wx3OkTq3LWTvgEGde__l75VDFzHUf9wvWnGxV7Xb9XsUmVzBZR1sijWCpH93fGkCFE_Fbp7F2H4SzS0lyWpa3nyG8UTnDqt7J693jPmVp_fE3fxBOF4o/w640-h394/931+%25E9%2586%25AB%25E5%25AD%25B8+%25E6%259C%25B1%25E5%25AD%2590%25E5%25AE%258F+%25E8%25AB%2596%25E5%259B%25A1%25E4%25BB%2594%25E4%25BA%25BA%25C3%25AA%25E5%25AD%25B8%25E7%25BF%2592%25E9%2597%259C%25E9%258D%25B5%25E6%259C%259F_%25E5%259C%2596.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p><br /></p><p>作者：<b>朱子宏</b></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">現此時濟濟爸母計計議論講：「Tse m̄免tsiah早學」、「án-ni囡仔siunn艱苦、擔重擔」。總--是學界一直lóng有一層假說，號做學習關鍵期（critical period hypothesis），細囝代先頭殼發育ê時，若順趁學寡才調 ，就ē做大路用，khah贏後日大勞煩tsiah致到sann平ê標準。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">一、雙目視覺（two-eye vision, stereopsis）</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Mā thang hiàm「立體視覺」，在早對猴仔等六畜ê實驗參臨床ê究勘，拍算上要緊是兩歲前，極ke三歲前<b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><i>1</i></span></b>。若準有各項干礙著目睭hōo看buē明ê問題，見若斜目、白內障、青光眼，tio̍h趕緊làng縫揣醫生tánn-tia̍p好勢，看是berh復健，iah是動刀法，tsiah buē kap tsit-tsūn khah急繼--ê sann閃身。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">二、泅水</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tse我m̄ bat tīr pubmed頂讀相關ê論，m̄-kú「原始反射」（primitive reflex）諒必kánn ē贊學泅，拍ka-la̍uh以早，量約是出世到三～六月日久，紅嬰仔thang自然學到精光<b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><i>2</i></span></b>。爸母了後免khai大錢，tshiànn先生來教泅。熱--天tshiânn藏bī tsiânn sù-sī，不過囡仔tng泅，爸母ài注神tsir-tsir-siòng，目光一目nih久lóng m̄-thang徙別位，m̄好放囝tū水。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">三、語言</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">有分別做第一（L1）kap第二（L2）。古早有囝hōo精牲khioh去養飼suah oh得學講人話ê例：Victor of Aveyron (c. 1788 – 1828)；有一个查某囡仔名是Genie，tann iáu tīr--leh，伊出世tīr頂世紀1957年，無偌久伊老爸hia̍p嫌掠伊智識有欠缺，將伊棄sak tīr睏房，13歲tsiah有社工探bāi，到tsit站仔iáu buē得thang學ē-hiáu言語，kan-ta幾lō詞nā-tiānn <b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><i>3</i></span></b>。所以有人報五歲內、也有人著出解說（kué-serh）上uànn青春期前定著學第一語言<span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b><i>4</i></b></span>。第二、第三語言mā siāng款 <i><b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">5</span></b></i>，berh「無疼」學習，講話liàn-tńg無臭奶呆是ná早ná妥當。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">因為科技進前，90年代起，科學家用功能性磁振造影查考腦部逐區域，設使學L2 tīr 11.2 (±1.5)歲khah早，據L1／L2一下出喙，仝所在teh活動，大漢suà pit-tshe <i><b><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">6</span></b></i>；ná慢得著L2，sann離L1 ná遠 <span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b><i>7</i></b></span>。囝兒若kā koh-iūnn話lām-sám講，序大mài gông-ngia̍h，伊起頭先ē án-ni無m̄-tio̍h，緊tsua̍h慢ē得明白通達（上緊四～五歲）<b><i><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">8</span></i></b>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">四、絕對音感（absolute pitch）</span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">有學者聚集三陣人來比phīng，一陣是三～四歲ê囡仔、一陣是五～六歲；另外是長成ê大人（21～39歲），同齊訓練六禮拜久，研究顯明五～六歲tsit組聽聲bat調ê才調上好，khah細漢--ê無的確hit-tang-tsūn khah歹聽話 <b><i><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">9</span></i></b>，有ê講是七歲到青春期來起因為止。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Kù薰、giàn毒，學歹khah大面tīr 18歲前，25歲後真罕得見。Ē酒痟80% mā tīr 30歲內 <b><i><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">10</span></i></b>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">飼囝本然m̄是容易事，ǹg望列位裁正。</span></p><div><br /></div><ol style=\"text-align: left;\"><li>Arch Ophthalmol. 1998;116(4):502-505. <br />doi:10.1001/archopht.116.4.502 <br />file:///C:/Users/THC/Downloads/emo7751.pdf<br /><br /></li><li>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rbrtZP1D0qc<br /><br /></li><li>http://bertbetterman.com/2016/09/environment-matters-the-story-of-genie/<br /><br /></li><li>Siegler, Robert (2006). How Children Develop, Exploring Child Develop Student Media Tool Kit &amp; Scientific American Reader to Accompany How Children Develop. New York: Worth Publishers<br /><br /></li><li>Snow, C.E.; Hoefnagel-Höhle, M. (December 1978). \"The Critical Period for Language Acquisition: Evidence from Second-Language Learning\". Child Development<br />Annu. Rev. Neurosci. 2004. 27:549–79<br /><br /></li><li>Nature volume 388, pages171–174(1997)<br /><br /></li><li>https://www.researchgate.net/publication/23628960_The_age_of_second_language_acquisition_determines_the_variability_in_activation_elicited_by_narration_in_three_languages_in_Broca's_and_Wernicke's_area<br /><br /></li><li>J Cogn Neurosci. 2008 January ; 20(1): 153–169. doi:10.1162/jocn.2008.20011. https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2643466/pdf/nihms-90696.pdf<br /><br /></li><li>https://www.researchgate.net/publication/41194498_Learning_the_Special_Note_Evidence_for_a_Critical_Period_for_Absolute_Pitch_Acquisition<br /><br /></li><li>Am J Psychiatry. 2003 Jun; 160(6): 1041–1052</li></ol><p><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: x-small; text-align: justify;\"><br /></span><br style=\"text-align: justify;\" /></p><div style=\"background-color: white; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>#</b></span></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>醫學台文 專欄，</b></span><span face=\"&quot;trebuchet ms&quot; , &quot;trebuchet&quot; , &quot;verdana&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"color: #666666; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案</b></span><b style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;\">。</b></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報319期，2020年10月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, trebuchet, verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------</div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #666666; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=